Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Remove the obsolete managed Git resource

FineSub's knowledge store is SQLite and no runtime path uses Git anymore.
Keeping MinGit in the resource manifest still exposes a download/install target,
adds it to diagnostics, and injects its directory into every worker PATH.

Remove the managed asset and the now-dead system-tool plumbing. Repository
maintenance remains a developer concern outside the packaged runtime.

